    "group": "Daemonic Incursion",
    "summary": "When a **LEGIONES DAEMONICA** unit of yours arrives using **[Deep Strike](vsdata:core-ability/deep-strike)**, it may be set up anywhere over 6\" horizontally from all enemy models, rather than over 8\", if either applies:\n\n- It is wholly inside your [Shadow of Chaos](vsdata:ability/chaos-daemons.the-shadow-of-chaos).\n- It is wholly within 6\" of a friendly **SKARBRAND**, **ROTIGUS**, **LORD OF CHANGE**, **KAIROS FATEWEAVER**, **GREAT UNCLEAN ONE**, **SHALAXI HELBANE**, **BLOODTHIRSTER** or **KEEPER OF SECRETS** unit that shares a **KHORNE**, **TZEENTCH**, **NURGLE** or **SLAANESH** keyword with it.",
